    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The light coming from the console's display illuminates the gratings on which you stand, catching your attention to look below. Down there, you see that this cabin you're in right now is on top of a large machine with countless coupled gears and long pipes all leading to the head of the engine. The observation point from which you stand doesn't allow you to see the bottom of this massive motor which is used to run the intricate hanging crane system outside. 

The display on the console showcases two green graphs, one on each monitor, with several large red circles, seemingly placed at random all throughout the scheme. These dots most likely represent the positions of the crane's many lifting arms available at your disposal. Some sections at both monitors are starting to fade out, the others outright not showing up. In the top right corner of the left screen you can see what seems to be a power bar, and it's showing a number: *21*. In between the two large monitors is a third one which shows two large rectangles on it. However, the diminished visuals there leave you with no useful information other than the fact that they are pulsating in orange color.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::With a few swipes, you clean the accumulated dust from the keyboard. The letters on them are still preserved and it doesn't take you long to figure the controls out.::

::This vantage point allows you to see very far away. By leaning back and forth you can observe every section of the room. Outside the double doors you've walked in is a wide open clear area suitable for lowering anything you can pick up with the crane.::

&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
